# Round Loop Architecture

Round-based games should follow this system structure.

Core systems:

RoundSystem  
PlayerSpawnSystem  
EliminationSystem  
WinDetectionSystem  
RewardSystem  

Each system should communicate through events rather than direct coupling.

Example flow:

Lobby → Round Start → Spawn Players → Gameplay → Win Detection → Rewards → Reset

Avoid implementing the entire round loop in one script.